  "anEx4Desc": "`motion=\"marquee\"` carries the whole list past continuously instead of showing one update at a time, which suits a standing headline strip where no single update is the point. Travel time is `secondsPerItem` times the number of updates, so more news takes longer to pass rather than passing faster.",
  "anEx5Title": "Updates that open something",
  "anEx5Desc": "Give `onItemSelect` and every update becomes a button, so it can be clicked or tabbed to and entered. Pair it with a dialog when the strip carries a headline and the full note lives elsewhere. Movement stops on hover and focus, which is what makes a travelling update possible to hit.",
