  "anPropAriaLabel": "Accessible name for the announcements region.",
  "anA11y1": "The strip is a labelled `region`. Automatic content changes use `aria-live=\"off\"`, so they do not repeatedly interrupt assistive technology.",
  "anA11y2": "When more than one update exists, previous, next, and pause/resume controls are keyboard reachable. The position uses a polite live region.",
  "anA11y3": "Rotation pauses while the web strip is hovered or contains focus, and the persistent pause control meets the moving-content requirement.",
  "anA11y4": "Marquee motion paints the run of updates twice to hide the loop seam. The duplicate is `inert` and `aria-hidden`, so each update is announced once and reached once by Tab. Under reduced motion the strip stops and becomes a static scrollable row.",
  "anUse1": "Use Announcements for concise, non-blocking application updates such as maintenance windows, releases, or service status.",
  "anUse2": "Keep each message self-contained and short enough to survive the single-line treatment on small screens.",
